<Base title="About" description="Meet Dr Mahantesh Bhairumali and explore his interests in clinical pharmacology, research, education, and digital health."><PageHeader eyebrow="About / The person behind the work" title="Medicine, with a wider lens." intro="I’m Dr Mahantesh Bhairumali, a physician with interests spanning clinical pharmacology, medical research, education, and digital health innovation." /><section class="section wrap two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">Professional perspective</p><h2>Connecting knowledge<br />and practical questions.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>This website brings together the different strands of my professional identity: medicine, research, teaching, and digital applications.</p><p>It is a place to explore work in progress, find scholarly and educational materials as they become available, and follow the development of digital tools.</p><p>My academic background, appointments, and career milestones will be added here once the details are ready to share.</p></div></section><section class="section tinted"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Areas of interest</p><div class="interest-grid">{interests.map(i => <article><span class="index-number">{i.number}</span><h2 class="h3">{i.title}</h2><p>{i.text}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="section wrap"><a class="button" href="/applications/">Explore the innovation lab <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></Base>
